{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    { "title": "Snakk RED", "type": "link", "url": "/grafana/d/snakk-red", "targetBlank": false },
    { "title": "Snakk Logs", "type": "link", "url": "/grafana/d/snakk-logs", "targetBlank": false }
  ],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Provisioned for Phase 3 — meters not yet emitted",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 0,
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "description": "Phase 3 of the observability rollout (see docs/OBSERVABILITY-TODO.md) adds the .NET Meters and ActivitySources below. This dashboard provisions the visualizations now; panels show \"No data\" until those meters ship. The exact metric names match the planned snakk.* meter names emitted by Snakk.ServiceDefaults once Phase 3 lands.",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Phase 3 stub dashboard\n\nThis dashboard wires up visualisations for the Phase 3 business meters defined in `docs/OBSERVABILITY-DESIGN-2026-05-24.md` §6 and `docs/OBSERVABILITY-TODO.md` Phase 3.\n\nMeters planned (none emitting yet):\n\n- **`snakk.posts.created`** — counter, labels: `community`, `type` (discussion vs comment).\n- **`snakk.auth.login_attempts`** — counter, label: `result` (success / wrong_password / locked_out / mfa_required).\n- **`snakk.cache.hits`** / **`snakk.cache.misses`** — counters, label: `cache_name`.\n- **`snakk.webhooks.delivery.duration`** — histogram, labels: `webhook_id`, `attempt_number`, `status`.\n- **`Snakk.LinkMetadata.Fetch`** ActivitySource — counters: `snakk.linkmeta.fetch.success`, `snakk.linkmeta.fetch.ssrf_blocked`, `snakk.linkmeta.fetch.parse_failed`, `snakk.linkmeta.fetch.timeout`.\n\nPanels light up automatically once the Snakk.ServiceDefaults emits these meters."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "title": "Engagement",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Posts created / min",
      "description": "Rate of posts and comments created. The top-line engagement signal. Sustained drop relative to historical baseline = something broke in the write path; pivot to Snakk RED 5xx panel for Snakk.Web.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum by (type) (rate(snakk_posts_created_total[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{type}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "lineWidth": 0, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } },
          "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Posts created — top 10 communities (last hour)",
      "description": "Where engagement is happening right now. Empty = no posts in the window.",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (community) (increase(snakk_posts_created_total[1h])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true } } },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Value", "desc": true }] } }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "title": "Authentication",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Login attempts / min by outcome",
      "description": "Login success vs failure modes. Sustained spike in 'wrong_password' or 'locked_out' = credential stuffing attempt; cross-reference Snakk Logs security panel for source IPs.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(snakk_auth_login_attempts_total[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{result}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "lineWidth": 0, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } },
          "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)"
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "success" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "wrong_password" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "yellow", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "locked_out" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "mfa_required" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Login success rate (rolling 5m)",
      "description": "Successful logins as a share of all attempts. Healthy in steady state >95%. Dropping into the yellow band sustained = a real auth incident.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(snakk_auth_login_attempts_total{result=\"success\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(snakk_auth_login_attempts_total[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "orientation": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent", "decimals": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [
            { "color": "red", "value": null },
            { "color": "yellow", "value": 80 },
            { "color": "green", "value": 95 }
          ]},
          "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "title": "Cache effectiveness",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Cache hit ratio by cache",
      "description": "Application-level cache hit ratio (separate from Postgres shared_buffers). Falling ratio on a previously-warm cache means an eviction or invalidation storm; pivot to Valkey dashboard for evictions/memory.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum by (cache_name) (rate(snakk_cache_hits_total[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (cache_name) (rate(snakk_cache_hits_total[5m]) + rate(snakk_cache_misses_total[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{cache_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0, "max": 100,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 },
          "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "title": "Webhook delivery",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Webhook delivery rate by status",
      "description": "Delivery outcomes for outbound webhooks. Sustained nonzero on 'failed' / 'dead_lettered' = a downstream receiver problem.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(snakk_webhooks_delivery_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 },
          "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Webhook delivery latency P50/P95",
      "description": "How long deliveries take. Slow downstream = retries pile up = the deliver queue grows; pair with Snakk Traces for the slow Snakk.Webhook.Deliver spans.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(snakk_webhooks_delivery_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(snakk_webhooks_delivery_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 5, "lineWidth": 2 },
          "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "title": "Link-metadata fetch (LinkMetadata SSRF surface)",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 42 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Link-metadata fetch outcomes / min",
      "description": "Outcomes of outbound link-preview fetches. ssrf_blocked = the URL was rejected by the host/IP allowlist (security-critical signal — should normally be at attack-detector levels); timeouts and parse_failed are operational signals.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 43 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(snakk_linkmeta_fetch_success_total[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "success" },
        { "expr": "sum(rate(snakk_linkmeta_fetch_ssrf_blocked_total[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "ssrf_blocked" },
        { "expr": "sum(rate(snakk_linkmeta_fetch_parse_failed_total[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "parse_failed" },
        { "expr": "sum(rate(snakk_linkmeta_fetch_timeout_total[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "timeout" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "lineWidth": 0, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } },
          "noValue": "No data yet (Phase 3)"
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "success" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "ssrf_blocked" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "parse_failed" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "yellow", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "timeout" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }] }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["snakk", "business", "phase-3-stub"],
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "",
  "title": "Snakk Business KPIs",
  "uid": "snakk-business",
  "version": 1
}
